title: HCI+AI research trends and technical analysis
description: This course provides an opportunity to conduct a through paper review about the topics of students' own individual or group HCI+AI projects. Students will be asked to read and review a series of the seminal literature drawn primarily from top-tier conferences and journals of ACM SIGCHI (https://programs.sigchi.org/) including, but not limited to, ACM CHI, ACM UbiComp, ACM UIST, ACM CSCW, IEEE ISMAR, ACM/IEEE HRI, ACM IUI, and so on.
